{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2023-05-16 09:15:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS HONORED AS A 2023 VETS INDEXES 5 STAR EMPLOYER', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITED RENTALS, INC. (NYSE: URI), THE WORLD'S LARGEST EQUIPMENT RENTAL COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS EARNED THE DESIGNATION VETS INDEXES 5 STAR EMPLOYER IN THE 2023 VETS INDEXES EMPLOYER AWARDS. THE AWARD RECOGNIZES THE ORGANIZATION'S COMMITMENT TO RECRUITING, HIRING, RETAINING, DEVELOPING, AND SUPPORTING VETERANS AND THE MILITARY-CONNECTED COMMUNITY. NEARLY 10 PERCENT OF UNITED RENTALS EMPLOYEES ARE MILITARY VETERANS. THIS YEAR, A RECORD NUMBER OF 239 ORGANI."}